## 📂 Repository Index & Architecture

### 1. [🤖 Navigant AI Automation Platform](./Navigant-AI-Automation)
*   **Core Logic:** Local containerized runtime configurations orchestrating automated workflows.
*   **Highlights:** Transitioned traditional linear pipelines into a **Goal-Directed Autonomous Tool-Calling Loop** (Navigant Student Guidance Agent MVP) using Google Gemini integrations via local nodes.
*   **Safety Features:** Strict deterministic data boundaries to prevent runtime hallucinations by catching lookup voids and safely throwing a `Halted: Data Incomplete` status.

### 2. [🌐 Navigant Portfolio Interface](./Navigant-portfolio)
*   **Core Logic:** Zero-dependency semantic HTML5/CSS3 frontend architecture.
*   **Highlights:** Deployed on Netlify under custom domain routing configurations, featuring a dedicated Build-In-Public layout (`story.html`) tracking live system milestones.

